\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Seven manipulation starts per row. Physical completion: goal reached at least once; false declarations: goal unmet when claimed. Success denominators retain API errors; other outcomes omit them. Gemini: three low-effort content-filter rejections, two high-effort request timeouts. Cost/time pairs: means over all/successful attempts. Episode time runs until termination. Costs: reconciled usage at published rates~\citep  {openai2026pricing,anthropic2026pricing,google2026pricing}; GPU costs excluded; $^{*}$ excludes unresolved usage; --: no success. Latency: median of per-attempt medians for completed decisions.}}{2}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
